Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.51,0:00:21.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}After about 5 minutes, the patient was asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.11,0:00:23.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The surgeon removed a growth from his neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.55,0:00:26.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Afterward, the patient said it felt as if his neck
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:27.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}had been scraped.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.34,0:00:28.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}But it hadn't hurt.
