Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.81,0:04:47.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Warren, the story goes, turned to the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.37,0:04:49.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Gentlemen, this is no humbug.
