Dialogue: 3,0:08:47.13,0:08:52.88,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}POST-ANESTHESIA CARE UNIT · USNS COMFORT
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.30,0:09:02.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}According to the National Library of Medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.05,0:09:05.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}general anesthesia puts you into a deep, sleep-like
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.09,0:09:08.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}state, so you do not feel pain during surgery, and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.08,0:09:10.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}you don't remember the procedure.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:59.55,0:09:05.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 934 0 l 934 132 l 0 132{\p0}
