Dialogue: 3,0:08:59.55,0:09:05.30,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}OPERATING ROOM TEAM TRAINING
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.21,0:09:25.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}During general anesthesia, blood pressure, pulse and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.51,0:09:27.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}breathing are monitored continuously.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.86,0:09:30.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Most often, the anesthesia is given by a doctor
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.84,0:09:32.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}called an anesthesiologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.55,0:09:34.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Sometimes, by a nurse anesthetist.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:22.46,0:09:28.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 995 0 l 995 132 l 0 132{\p0}
