Dialogue: 3,0:09:22.46,0:09:28.21,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARMY GRADUATE PROGRAM IN ANESTHESIA NURSING
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.15,0:09:36.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Training never stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.47,0:09:39.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Operating teams rehearse and review together, so the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.72,0:09:40.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}real day goes right.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:35.40,0:09:41.15,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 789 0 l 789 132 l 0 132{\p0}
