Dialogue: 3,0:09:35.40,0:09:41.15,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}OPERATING ROOM TRAINING DAY
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.51,0:09:53.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Before 1846, a surgeon raced the patient's pain, and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.21,0:09:55.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}the patient was awake for every second.
