Dialogue: 3,0:09:49.76,0:09:55.51,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}"THE FIRST PUBLIC DEMONSTRATION OF SURGICAL ANAESTHESIA"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.43,0:10:00.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}After one Friday morning in Boston, patients could sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.24,0:10:03.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And today, surgical teams like this one can take
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.45,0:10:04.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}their time.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:56.68,0:10:02.43,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1079 0 l 1079 132 l 0 132{\p0}
