Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.63,0:10:07.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Within a year, the news had crossed an ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.66,0:10:11.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Within 15 years, it was in field hospitals across a
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.10,0:10:12.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}nation at war.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.04,0:10:15.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And it began with a dentist, a surgeon, and a
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.07,0:10:17.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}patient who said it didn't hurt.
